        <p>AND BECAUSE BROOKE, BONDS' TEA is sola everywhere and always of the same good qualities and at the same prices.</p>
        <p>THUS FOR THE ABOVE REASONS, YOU HAVE THE BEST POSSIBLE GUARANTEES THAT</p>
