        <p>While the Eltomach recovers its normal tone, the putrid undigested food is cleared away, and the poor dyspep- tic is relieved of his load of Inhery, once more and en- joys go d health and looks forward to happiness and long li . If yfour occupation is an unhealthy one, if you are ex- posed to the weather, or work long hours in close rooms if your constitution is weakened, er your health under- mined ; or if yen are in any way not "up to the mark," use Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. It never fails to strengthen the weakened system, to brace the nerves, and fortify the constitution..</p>
        <p>Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters is purely vegetable and certified by Analysts to be pure and harmless. It may be safely taken by delicate ladies and children in all cases of weakness. It is sold in Bottles, at 2s. 9d. and 44. Bd, each, by all Chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors, or direct from the Proprietors,The Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Corn pany Ltd.. Llanelly, South Wales, Carriage Free b Parcels Post. Beware of Imitations. See the nam •1 Gwilym Evans "on Label, Stamp, Bottle.</p>
