        <p>"We have seen hosts of letters from people who have received great benefit from the use of Clarke's Blood Mixture. It cannot be too highly estimated, for it cleanses and clears the blood from all impurities." This is a good testimonial from the Family Doctor, which goes on further to say "It is the finest Blood Purifier that science and skill have brought to Aght,and we can with the utmost confidence recommend It o our subscribers and the public generally."</p>
        <p>Warranted to cleanse the blood from all Impurities, from whatever cause arising For Scrofula, Scurvy, Eczema, skin sad Blood Diseases,,Pimples, and Sores of all kinds, Its effects ans marvellous. It is the only real specific for Gout and Rheumatic Pains, for it removes the cause from the blood and bones. Thousands of Testimonials. In bottles 2s. 94. end lis. each, of all Chemists. Sent for 33 or 132 stamps by Pro prietors. LINCOLN AND MIDLAND COUNTIHR DRC COMPANY. LINCOLN. Beware of Worthless Imitation</p>
