        <p>TRUNKS, DRESS BASKETS, FITTED BAGS, FANCY GOODS. GEORGE HENRY LEE &amp; Co., LIMITED. BASNETT STREET. LIVERPOOL. VIOLINS, Genuine Old Instruments, at Reason- able Prices. For quality, Violas, and Violoncsqlos. V- lOLINS, bought, sold, lent on hire, and taken In exchange.</p>
