        <head>FRODSHAIL</head>
        <p>FRODSHAIL</p>
        <p>--- Pouca Nms.—Before Mr. A. Thomas on Saturday. at the Frodsham Police Court, William Bonner was sent to prison for 14 days for begging at aelsby, the previ- ous day.—P.C. Needh4m proved the case.—On Wednes- day before the same magistrate. Richard Regan was also charged with begging at Dunham Hill, on Tuesday. P.C. Bradley proved the casn, and defendant was corn- roi ted for seven days hard labour.</p>
